Hi<%= @user.profile&.display_name.present? ? " #{@user.profile.display_name}" : "" %>,

Good news — a spot opened up for <%= @event.title %>, and you've been moved off the waitlist into a confirmed registration.

When: <%= @event.start_at.strftime("%A, %B %-d, %Y at %-I:%M %p") %>
<% if @event.location.present? -%>
Where: <%= @event.location %>
<% end -%>

<% if @owed_cents.positive? && @registration.payment_status != "paid" -%>
Payment pending — your spot is held, but please complete payment to secure it. You can pay by KHQR from the event page:
<%= @event_url %>
<% else -%>
See you there!
<% end -%>

— The Rally team
